==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*jьgrati}}. Cognate to {{cog|sh|ȉgrati}} and {{cog|cs|hrát}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|игра́ть}}
